{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211108001:0":{"text":"조금 전 유령이 지나갔는데... 그건... 아버지였어!","source_cn":"刚刚有个幽灵飘过去了！那家伙……是我父亲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DF07F4FBF443380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211108002:0":{"text":"보물을 찾으러 바다로 나간 아버지는 그렇게 돌아오지 않으셨어. 그런데 이곳에 계실 줄이야...","source_cn":"他出海寻宝再也没回来，没想到在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC551E73FD59F32D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211108003:0":{"text":"유령? 어디? 나는 아직 못 봤어. 얼른 나도 보여줘!","source_cn":"哪有幽灵？我还没见过幽灵呢，快让我看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E593A5D40EEDB61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211108004:0":{"text":"...유령?","source_cn":"……幽灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0EA04B622EB79A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211108005:0":{"text":"어라? 너희는 못 봤어?","source_cn":"啊？你们都没看见吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7E6C2557F788B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choic